abstract: 'Three Rust crates for an append-only Merkle log hashed as RFC 9162: tree
  hashes and proofs, tlog-tiles storage with Ed25519 signed checkpoints, and an
  indexed authenticated log with an rfc9162-sidecar CLI.'
